  "notes": "Only the upstream portable reference exists. sampler_4x is scalar interleaving, not AVX2; AVX2 is unavailable (--). Contrary to the variable-length expectation, this revision always emits SHUTTLE_BYTES and verifies that exact size. The internal rANS payload is variable and padded; unpadded length reads its explicit two-byte little-endian length after seedC and excludes only unused rANS reservation bytes. KAT: original deterministic vector generator, ten rounds with original/tampered-signature/tampered-message checks. No expanded-key API. Timing uses native randombytes; fixed-seed checks use bench entropy. Timing update: fresh encoded keypair/signature per KeyGen/Sign/Verify triple, 20 complete warmup triples, 32-byte zero message. Ref has no bench-added auto-vectorization suppression. Algorithm source and native randomness are unchanged."
